{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1515.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"8a73c47c5dc12044b0f5b300868f59eb28d2bfb782c744c6d1042ab5574f508f","ja":"ありがとうございます！\nそれじゃあ、次の教科は……。","zh":"谢谢您！\n那么，下一门科目是……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1515.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"ac801445d0bbe31a2aa97cb3c2b759e031aa1d2872b54c56bd3122bc0795438e","ja":"いえ。適度に頭を休ませるのも大事です。\nここで一度、休憩をとりましょう。","zh":"不。适度让大脑休息也很重要。\n先在这里休息一下吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1515.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"22fd21321db5be20deabe41e27214a2ca205d1984dda57d2bb4537ef76413f4f","ja":"あ、そうですね。私、お菓子持ってきてるんです。\nよかったら食べませんか？","zh":"啊，也是呢。我带了点心来，\n不介意的话要吃点吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1515.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"16c57cbd24319482fdc1b86476a89d84743a539a8c961c8f11ba5746f3811bcc","ja":"いいんですか？　それなら、お言葉に甘えて。","zh":"可以吗？那我就恭敬不如从命了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
